- # `↯/s.100.4` — `EmailAddress.Error`
+ # `↯/s.100.4` — `EmailAddress.Error`

- Raised when a value cannot be parsed as a valid email address.
+ Порождается, когда значение нельзя разобрать как допустимый адрес электронной почты.

- ## Cause
+ ## Причина

- Urticose validates email addresses against the syntax rules in
- RFC 5321 / 5322 (with practical relaxations). The message is `the
+ Urticose проверяет адреса электронной почты по синтаксическим правилам
+ RFC 5321 / 5322 (с практическими послаблениями). Сообщение — `the

- email address is not valid because $reason`.
+ email address is not valid because $reason`.

- ## Variants
+ ## Варианты

- ```tabular
+ ```tabular

- column  Code
- column  Reason
- column  Meaning
- column  Message
- column  Resolution
- row  `↯/s.100.4.1`  `Empty`  The value is empty.  `[↯/s.100.4.1] the email address is not valid because it is empty`  Provide a non-empty address.
- row  `↯/s.100.4.2`  `InvalidDomain`  The domain part is neither a valid hostname nor a valid IP literal.  `[↯/s.100.4.2] the email address is not valid because the domain is not a valid hostname: the character _ is not allowed in a hostname`  Correct the domain syntax; consult the inner `HostnameError`/`IpAddress.Error` variant for specifics.
- row  `↯/s.100.4.3`  `LongLocalPart`  The local part exceeds 64 characters.  `[↯/s.100.4.3] the email address is not valid because the local part is more than 64 characters long`  Shorten the local part to at most 64 characters.
- row  `↯/s.100.4.4`  `TerminalPeriod`  The local part ends in a period.  `[↯/s.100.4.4] the email address is not valid because the local part ends in a period, which is not allowed`  Remove the trailing period.
- row  `↯/s.100.4.5`  `SuccessivePeriods`  The local part contains two adjacent periods.  `[↯/s.100.4.5] the email address is not valid because the local part contains two adjacent periods`  Remove one of the periods, or quote the local part if successive periods are required.
- row  `↯/s.100.4.6`  `InitialPeriod`  The local part starts with a period.  `[↯/s.100.4.6] the email address is not valid because the local part starts with a period, which is not allowed`  Remove the leading period.
- row  `↯/s.100.4.7`  `UnescapedQuote`  A double-quote in the local part was not escaped.  `[↯/s.100.4.7] the email address is not valid because the local part contains a quote character which is not escaped`  Either escape the quote with a backslash or use a properly quoted local part.
- row  `↯/s.100.4.8`  `UnclosedQuote`  The quoted local part has no closing quote.  `[↯/s.100.4.8] the email address is not valid because the quoted local part has no closing quote`  Add the missing `"`.
- row  `↯/s.100.4.9`  `MissingDomain`  The address has no domain part.  `[↯/s.100.4.9] the email address is not valid because the domain is missing`  Append `@` followed by the domain.
- row  `↯/s.100.4.10`  `MissingAtSymbol`  The address contains no `@`.  `[↯/s.100.4.10] the email address is not valid because the at-symbol is missing`  Insert `@` between the local part and the domain.
- row  `↯/s.100.4.11`  `UnclosedIpAddress`  The domain begins with `[` but does not end with `]`.  `[↯/s.100.4.11] the email address is not valid because the domain begins with [ but does not end with ]`  Close the IP-literal with `]`.
- row  `↯/s.100.4.12`  `InvalidChar`  The local part contains a character that is not allowed.  `[↯/s.100.4.12] the email address is not valid because the local part contains the character > which is not allowed`  Remove the offending character or quote the local part to permit it.
+ column  Код
+ column  Причина
+ column  Значение
+ column  Сообщение
+ column  Решение
+ row  `↯/s.100.4.1`  `Empty`  Значение пусто.  `[↯/s.100.4.1] the email address is not valid because it is empty`  Укажите непустой адрес.
+ row  `↯/s.100.4.2`  `InvalidDomain`  Доменная часть не является ни допустимым именем хоста, ни допустимым IP-литералом.  `[↯/s.100.4.2] the email address is not valid because the domain is not a valid hostname: the character _ is not allowed in a hostname`  Исправьте синтаксис домена; подробности — во вложенном варианте `HostnameError`/`IpAddress.Error`.
+ row  `↯/s.100.4.3`  `LongLocalPart`  Локальная часть длиннее 64 символов.  `[↯/s.100.4.3] the email address is not valid because the local part is more than 64 characters long`  Сократите локальную часть не более чем до 64 символов.
+ row  `↯/s.100.4.4`  `TerminalPeriod`  Локальная часть заканчивается точкой.  `[↯/s.100.4.4] the email address is not valid because the local part ends in a period, which is not allowed`  Удалите завершающую точку.
+ row  `↯/s.100.4.5`  `SuccessivePeriods`  Локальная часть содержит две точки подряд.  `[↯/s.100.4.5] the email address is not valid because the local part contains two adjacent periods`  Удалите одну из точек или заключите локальную часть в кавычки, если точки подряд необходимы.
+ row  `↯/s.100.4.6`  `InitialPeriod`  Локальная часть начинается с точки.  `[↯/s.100.4.6] the email address is not valid because the local part starts with a period, which is not allowed`  Удалите начальную точку.
+ row  `↯/s.100.4.7`  `UnescapedQuote`  Двойная кавычка в локальной части не экранирована.  `[↯/s.100.4.7] the email address is not valid because the local part contains a quote character which is not escaped`  Экранируйте кавычку обратной косой чертой или используйте правильно заключённую в кавычки локальную часть.
+ row  `↯/s.100.4.8`  `UnclosedQuote`  У заключённой в кавычки локальной части нет закрывающей кавычки.  `[↯/s.100.4.8] the email address is not valid because the quoted local part has no closing quote`  Добавьте недостающую `"`.
+ row  `↯/s.100.4.9`  `MissingDomain`  У адреса нет доменной части.  `[↯/s.100.4.9] the email address is not valid because the domain is missing`  Допишите `@` и за ним домен.
+ row  `↯/s.100.4.10`  `MissingAtSymbol`  Адрес не содержит `@`.  `[↯/s.100.4.10] the email address is not valid because the at-symbol is missing`  Вставьте `@` между локальной частью и доменом.
+ row  `↯/s.100.4.11`  `UnclosedIpAddress`  Домен начинается с `[`, но не заканчивается `]`.  `[↯/s.100.4.11] the email address is not valid because the domain begins with [ but does not end with ]`  Закройте IP-литерал символом `]`.
+ row  `↯/s.100.4.12`  `InvalidChar`  Локальная часть содержит недопустимый символ.  `[↯/s.100.4.12] the email address is not valid because the local part contains the character > which is not allowed`  Удалите недопустимый символ или заключите локальную часть в кавычки, чтобы разрешить его.

